---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="My background and interests"
  pubDate={new Date('June 16 2026')}
  heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
  <p>
    I'm a full-stack software engineer with a background in theoretical Computer
    Science (think type theory & language design). I love finding elegant
    solutions to complex problems, especially when it leads to reliable and
    easy-to-use software.
  </p>

  <p>
    I'm having a lot of fun with Rust at the moment! The ownership model for
    memory management is really special and it's helped me think about low-level
    concepts in completely new ways. That and having the most theoretically
    robust type system of all mainstream (sorry Haskell) languages out there.
  </p>
</Layout>
